her the service can reach the bus, and is changed only under a window; contract is refused at runtime.","enum":["hot","reach","contract"],"type":"string"},"ConfigChangeEvent":{"description":"One change, as it ended (v1.md 2.17), after RFC 6470's netconf-config-change: events/change/<ulid>. The attribution is what the change's caller claimed, never authentication.","properties":{"actor":{"type":"string"},"claimed_source":{"type":"string"},"edits":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Edit"},"type":"array"},"instance":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"outcome":{"enum":["applied","confirmed","rolled-back","partial"],"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"service":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"}},"required":["service","instance","revision","token","outcome","edits"],"type":"object"},"ConfigError":{"description":"The app detail of config.v1's operations (v1.md 2.5): restart-required for a contract group, device-refused with the device's words.","properties":{"code":{"enum":["restart-required","device-refused"],"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code"],"type":"object"},"ConfigStatus":{"description":"The compact status (v1.md 2.19), state/status: what a constrained face can afford. The values by group and name; a sensitive value, and one the owner cannot read back, is never present.","properties":{"confirm_floor_s":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"desired":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DesiredReport"},"instance":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"last_change":{"$ref":"#/$defs/LastChange"},"pending":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Pending"},"revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"values":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ParamValue"},"type":"object"},"type":"object"}},"required":["instance","revision","confirm_floor_s","values"],"type":"object"},"ConfigView":{"description":"The read-back (v1.md 2.3), state/view: the served schema and the running values in one document. A GET on it is the read. Never carries a sensitive value.","properties":{"confirm_floor_s":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"desired":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DesiredReport"},"groups":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Group"},"maxItems":16,"type":"array"},"instance":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"last_change":{"$ref":"#/$defs/LastChange"},"pending":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Pending"},"revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"service":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["service","instance","revision","confirm_floor_s","groups"],"type":"object"},"ControlReply":{"description":"The reply to confirm, cancel, extend and persist (v1.md 2.10): the read-back after the act, or the compact status when the request asked for it.","oneOf":[{"properties":{"view":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ConfigView"}},"required":["view"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"status":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ConfigStatus"}},"required":["status"],"type":"object"}]},"ControlRequest":{"description":"The body of confirm, cancel, extend and persist (v1.md 2.10, 2.13): the change's token; for extend alone, the new window from now; and which document the reply carries, the view by default.","properties":{"answer":{"enum":["view","status"],"type":"string"},"confirm_s":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"}},"required":["token"],"type":"object"},"DesiredConfig":{"description":"A desired document for a config.v1 server (v1.md 2.18), for an authoring service's own contract to carry: no config.v1 resource does. Values by group and name, under the author's revision.","properties":{"revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"values":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ParamValue"},"type":"object"},"type":"object"}},"required":["revision","values"],"type":"object"},"DesiredRefusal":{"description":"Why the server did not converge a desired document, and where (v1.md 2.18).","properties":{"code":{"enum":["reach","contract","sensitive","not_found","invalid_request","unavailable","busy","device-refused"],"type":"string"},"group":{"type":"string"},"parameter":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code","group"],"type":"object"},"DesiredReport":{"description":"What the server did with the last desired document it acted on (v1.md 2.18): its revision, and converged, refused before anything applied, or failed partway.","properties":{"observed_revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"outcome":{"enum":["converged","refused","failed"],"type":"string"},"refusal":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DesiredRefusal"}},"required":["observed_revision","outcome"],"type":"object"},"Edit":{"description":"One parameter a change set (v1.md 2.17): its group and name, the value before the change and the value the change set. A sensitive parameter's edit is redacted, with neither value.","properties":{"group":{"type":"string"},"new":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ParamValue"},"old":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ParamValue"},"parameter":{"type":"string"},"redacted":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["group","parameter"],"type":"object"},"Group":{"description":"One group: the parameters that change together, the unit a set addresses, with its class and whether the startup allowlist lets a set reach it (v1.md 2.2, 2.16).","properties":{"class":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Class"},"description":{"type":"string"},"name":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"parameters":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Parameter"},"type":"array"},"writable":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["name","class","description","writable","parameters"],"type":"object"},"LastChange":{"description":"The most recent change made permanent at runtime in this instance: confirmed, or applied without a window. Never a pending change (v1.md 2.6).","properties":{"groups":{"items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"}},"required":["token","groups"],"type":"object"},"ParamValue":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"integer"},{"type":"string"}],"description":"One parameter's value, untagged: a boolean, a signed 64-bit integer, or text (v1.md 2.2). No float: a value that needs one is an integer in a finer unit."},"Parameter":{"description":"One parameter as the view shows it: its declaration, and what the owner runs with. Tagged by kind. A sensitive parameter never carries value or startup; a value the owner cannot read back is absent, never guessed (v1.md 2.2, 2.3, 2.15).","oneOf":[{"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"bool"},"name":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sensitive":{"type":"boolean"},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Source"},"startup":{"type":"boolean"},"value":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["name","kind","description"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"integer"},"max":{"type":"integer"},"min":{"type":"integer"},"name":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sensitive":{"type":"boolean"},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Source"},"startup":{"type":"integer"},"unit":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["name","kind","description"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"text"},"name":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sensitive":{"type":"boolean"},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Source"},"startup":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","kind","description"],"type":"object"}]},"Pending":{"description":"The change applied, or armed, and not yet confirmed (v1.md 2.7): its token, its groups in the order they joined, the instant its undo runs, and whether every group of it is applied yet.","properties":{"applied":{"type":"boolean"},"deadline":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Time"},"groups":{"items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"}},"required":["token","groups","deadline","applied"],"type":"object"},"PendingReply":{"description":"The reply to a set on a reach group, sent before the change is applied (v1.md 2.9): the change's token, when the group applies, and when the change rolls back unless confirmed.","properties":{"apply_at":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Time"},"deadline":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Time"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"}},"required":["token","apply_at","deadline"],"type":"object"},"SetReply":{"description":"The reply to a set (v1.md 2.9): the read-back after the apply, or a dry run's would-be read-back; or, for a reach group, the pending reply before the apply.","oneOf":[{"properties":{"applied":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ConfigView"}},"required":["applied"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"pending":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PendingReply"}},"required":["pending"],"type":"object"}]},"SetRequest":{"description":"The body of @op/set/{group} (v1.md 2.5): values for some parameters of the group, and, each optional, the window, the pending change's token to join, the revision the caller read, a key that makes a retry return the first answer, and a dry run.","properties":{"confirm_s":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"dry_run":{"type":"boolean"},"expected_revision":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"idempotency_key":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Token"},"values":{"additionalProperties":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ParamValue"},"type":"object"}},"required":["values"],"type":"object"},"Source":{"description":"Where a running value came from (v1.md 2.3): the owner's built-in default, its startup file, its persisted layer, or a change in this instance.","enum":["default","file","overlay","runtime"],"type":"string"},"Time":{"description":"An instant on the owner's clock: an RFC 3339 date-time in UTC, written with Z (v1.md 2.8).","format":"date-time","type":"string"},"Token":{"description":"A change's name, minted by the owner, never reused by any instance of the service (v1.md 2.6).","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"$id":"config.json","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema"},"kind":"jsonschema"}}}